title: 'pallet-xcm: improve `weigh_message` benchmark'
doc:
- audience: Runtime Dev
  description: |-
    Improves the `weigh_message` benchmark. Adds `pallet_xcm::benchmarking::Config::wrap_call`,
    which defaults to `batch_call` with a single call. You can override it if you have a call
    that dispatches a single inner call.
crates:
- name: pallet-xcm
  bump: minor
- name: asset-hub-westend-runtime
  bump: patch
